                                    <h3>Understand the Scenario Clearly</h3>
                                </div>
                                <p>Before you speak, carefully read or listen to the given situation. Make sure you fully understand what is being asked of you, whether it's giving advice, making a complaint, offering help, or apologizing. This applies to both PTE Academic Respond to a Situation and PTE Core Respond to a Situation tasks.</p>
